[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/882231826","html_url":"https://github.com/rclone/rclone/issues/5463#issuecomment-882231826","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/5463","id":882231826,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAQ-n5M40lcoS","user":{"login":"natecollins","id":2531698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzE2OTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2531698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins","html_url":"https://github.com/natecollins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-07-19T04:42:13Z","updated_at":"2021-07-19T04:42:13Z","body":"I've also experienced this recently with a `move` and was surprised to find source files were deleted after having used `--ignore-existing` where existing matching filenames were present on the dest. Fortunately, I was only testing my assumptions and didn't lose any data. I had expected any source files would be ignored and left in the source dir if a matching dest file existed, similar to how rsync's `--ignore-existing` works. Said functionality would be useful to prevent accidental clobbering of files.\r\n\r\nI did find another forum post where the topic was discussed in some depth ( [https://forum.rclone.org/t/unexpected-dangerous-behaviour-with-move-immutable-and-ignore-existing-flags/16616](https://forum.rclone.org/t/unexpected-dangerous-behaviour-with-move-immutable-and-ignore-existing-flags/16616) ), but it was auto-closed due to inactivity.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/882231826/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"natecollins","id":2531698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzE2OTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2531698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins","html_url":"https://github.com/natecollins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natecollins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/887640477","html_url":"https://github.com/rclone/rclone/issues/5463#issuecomment-887640477","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/5463","id":887640477,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAQ-n5M406FGd","user":{"login":"ncw","id":536803,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNjgwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/536803?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw","html_url":"https://github.com/ncw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/